hu-071-wangjian:p001:m0049","surface":"王敦","start":49,"end":51,"person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-071-wangjian","book_id":"b-jinshu-071","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-071-wangjian-ws2595541"},{"id":"c-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin:p001","text":"鑒弟濤及弟子戭，並有才筆。濤字茂略，曆著作郎、無錫令。戭字庭堅，亦為著作。並早卒。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":70,"last_line":70,"raw_start":5598,"raw_end":5639,"raw_character_offsets":[5598,5599,5600,5601,5602,5603,5604,5605,5606,5607,5608,5609,5610,5611,5612,5613,5614,5615,5616,5617,5618,5619,5620,5621,5622,5623,5624,5625,5626,5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633,5634,5635,5636,5637,5638],"revision_id":2595541},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin:p001:m0000","surface":"鑒","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"dkd_jrm_hin","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin:p001:m0002","surface":"濤","start":2,"end":3,"person_id":"yyk_ziw_so2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin:p001:m0006","surface":"戭","start":6,"end":7,"person_id":"7o0_9qh_xv1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin","book_id":"b-jinshu-071","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin-ws2595541"},{"id":"c-jinshu-071-xiongyuan:p005","text":"轉丞相參軍。是時琅邪國侍郎王鑒勸帝親征杜弢，遠又上疏曰：「皇綱失統，中夏多故，聖主肇祚，遠奉西都。梓宮外次，未反園陵，逆寇游魂，國賊未夷。明公憂勞，乃心王室，伏讀聖教，人懷慷慨。杜弢小豎，寇抄湘川，比年征討，經載不夷。昔高宗伐鬼方，三年乃克，用兵之難，非獨在今。伏以古今之霸王遭時艱難，亦有親征以隆大勳，亦有遣將以平小寇。今公親征，文武將吏、度支籌量、舟輿器械所出若足用者，然後可征。愚謂宜如前遣五千人，徑與水軍進征，既可得速，必不後時。昔齊用穰苴，燕晉退軍；秦用王翦，克平南荊。必使督護得才，即賊不足慮也。」會弢已平，轉從事中郎，累遷太子中庶子、尚書左丞、散騎常侍。帝每歎其忠公，謂曰：「卿在朝正色，不茹柔吐剛，忠亮至到，可為王臣也。吾所欣賴，卿其勉之！」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":35,"last_line":35,"raw_start":2714,"raw_end":3043,"raw_character_offsets":[2714,2715,2716,2717,2718,2719,2720,2721,2722,2723,2724,2725,2726